  "Settings.TextScaleChanged": "Text size set to {0}%.",
  "Settings.CloseToTray": "Hide the application in the system tray instead of closing it",
  "Settings.CloseToTrayHint": "Off by default. After confirming with OK, closing the main window, including X, Alt+F4 and Close in the Windows system menu, hides it without exiting. Explicit File → Exit and Exit Yamahama in the tray icon menu still exit, with confirmation if enabled. Escape does not exit the application.",
